        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is definitely a tough game. You can't do without patience and nerves of steel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is it about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main character, the &quot;King of Slimes&quot;, is beige and a big fan of mango. For the sake of this delicacy, you will have to overcome difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over spikes and chasms, dodge cannonballs, avoid hostile slimes, but REACH THE END!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How about controls?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In words, it's simple. One eye on the slime, the other on the Power Scale. Stop the slider at the right place on the Power Scale with the &quot;Space&quot; key and make a jump. It will determine the strength of EVERY jump.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A unique character control system using the power scale;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A story mode of 4 acts. Will introduce you to the fate of the future &quot;King of Slimes&quot;;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various obstacles with their own characteristics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level assessment on a three-star system depending on your progress;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 bright levels;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beautiful and charming graphics.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is definitely a tough game. You can't do without patience and nerves of steel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is it about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main character, the &quot;King of Slimes&quot;, is beige and a big fan of mango. For the sake of this delicacy, you will have to overcome difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over spikes and chasms, dodge cannonballs, avoid hostile slimes, but REACH THE END!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How about controls?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In words, it's simple. One eye on the slime, the other on the Power Scale. Stop the slider at the right place on the Power Scale with the &quot;Space&quot; key and make a jump. It will determine the strength of EVERY jump.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A unique character control system using the power scale;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A story mode of 4 acts. Will introduce you to the fate of the future &quot;King of Slimes&quot;;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various obstacles with their own characteristics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level assessment on a three-star system depending on your progress;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 bright levels;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Beautiful and charming graphics.</p>",
        "short_description": "This is a challenging precision platformer with cute Kawaii graphics about the &quot;Slime King&quot;. Just go ahead and jump towards the challenges, and also get to know the story of the main character in the &quot;story mode&quot;.",
